[
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "欢迎来到KC桌面。今天我们用一份最新\n研报，拆一个值得继续跟踪的问题。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.502,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC桌面",
      "研报"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "最近新能源车企的财报密集发布，有一家\n的数据特别有意思，营收翻了一倍多，但\n环比却跌了四分之一，",
    "start": 6.862,
    "end": 16.242,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "新能源车企",
      "财报",
      "营收"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这到底该怎么看？",
    "start": 16.602,
    "end": 18.181,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "这到底该怎么"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "你说的是蔚来，他们刚发了2026年第\n一季度的业绩。营收255亿人民币，同\n比大增112%，这确实很亮眼，",
    "start": 18.541,
    "end": 29.78,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "蔚来",
      "2026年第一季度",
      "营收"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "但环比下降26%，因为一季度是传统淡\n季，交付量也受春节影响。",
    "start": 30.14,
    "end": 37.663,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "环比",
      "下降26%",
      "一季度"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那这个同比弹性较高的增长，是靠什么撑\n起来的？是卖得更多了，还是单车价格上\n去了？",
    "start": 38.023,
    "end": 46.197,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "同比",
      "弹性",
      "增长"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "两者都有。交付量8.35万辆，同比增\n了98%，接近弹性较高。更重要的是，\n单车均价环比还涨了8%，",
    "start": 46.557,
    "end": 59.328,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "交付量",
      "8.35万辆",
      "同比"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "主要是高端车型ES8卖得好，占了总销\n量的54%。",
    "start": 59.688,
    "end": 65.121,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "高端车型",
      "ES8",
      "总销量"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以ES8成了利润奶牛？那毛利率应该\n也改善了不少吧。",
    "start": 65.481,
    "end": 70.775,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "ES8",
      "利润奶牛",
      "毛利率"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，整体毛利率达到19%，同比提升了\n11.4个百分点，车辆毛利率也有18\n.8%。",
    "start": 71.135,
    "end": 79.494,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "毛利率",
      "19%",
      "同比"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这已经是连续第二个季度实现非通用会计\n准则下的盈利了，净利润虽然还是亏了4\n.96亿，",
    "start": 79.854,
    "end": 88.167,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "连续第二个季度",
      "非通用会计准则",
      "盈利"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "但亏损同比缩小了93%。",
    "start": 88.527,
    "end": 91.267,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "亏损",
      "同比"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这听起来像是基本面在持续好转。那对于\n二季度，管理层给了什么指引？",
    "start": 91.627,
    "end": 97.85,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "基本面",
      "二季度",
      "管理层"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "二季度交付指引是11万到11.5万辆\n，同比增53%到60%。营收指引是3\n28亿到344亿，",
    "start": 98.21,
    "end": 108.752,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "二季度",
      "交付指引",
      "11万"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "同比增72%到81%。算下来，二季度\n的单车均价大概在26.7万左右，比一\n季度微降2%。",
    "start": 109.112,
    "end": 118.539,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "同比",
      "72%",
      "81%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "为什么均价会微降？是不是因为新车型开\n始上量了？",
    "start": 118.899,
    "end": 123.822,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "均价",
      "微降",
      "新车型"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错，二季度会有新车型，比如乐道L8\n0和ES9。尤其是ES9，下周就要正\n式发布了。根据行业调研，",
    "start": 124.182,
    "end": 135.188,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "二季度",
      "新车型",
      "乐道L80"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "ES9的预订单反馈不错，市场都在盯着\n它的表现，这可能会成为下半年的关键变\n量。",
    "start": 135.548,
    "end": 143.489,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "ES9",
      "预订单",
      "市场"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那关于成本方面，有什么值得关注的点吗\n？原材料价格波动对毛利有没有影响？",
    "start": 143.849,
    "end": 150.908,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "成本",
      "原材料价格",
      "毛利"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "管理层提到，锂、铝、铜这些原材料涨价\n，每辆车成本大概会增加一万块，但一季\n度因为库存的原因还没完全体现。",
    "start": 151.268,
    "end": 162.785,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "锂",
      "铝",
      "铜"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "不过他们仍然维持二季度和全年车辆毛利\n率17%到18%的目标，说明对成本控\n制有信心。",
    "start": 163.145,
    "end": 172.433,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "二季度",
      "全年",
      "车辆毛利率"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那除了卖车，蔚来在其他业务上有没有新\n的布局？",
    "start": 172.793,
    "end": 177.484,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "那除了卖车",
      "蔚来在其他业"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有，管理层强调非车辆业务的毛利率目标\n是20%。另外，他们的自研芯片神玑N\nX9031，",
    "start": 177.844,
    "end": 187.41,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "非车辆业务",
      "毛利率",
      "20%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "目标是到下半年渗透率达到80%到85\n%。换电站方面，今年计划新建1000\n座，",
    "start": 187.77,
    "end": 197.383,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "下半年",
      "渗透率",
      "80%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "第三代换电站从三季度开始部署。",
    "start": 197.743,
    "end": 200.855,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "第三代换电站",
      "三季度",
      "部署"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这些听起来都是长期投入，那短期来看，\n他们今年能实现经营利润转正吗？",
    "start": 201.215,
    "end": 207.484,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "经营利润",
      "转正"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "管理层维持了2026年非通用会计准则\n下经营利润盈亏平衡的指引。但实现这个\n目标，",
    "start": 207.844,
    "end": 215.832,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "2026年",
      "非通用会计准则",
      "经营利润"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "关键要看新车型ES9能不能持续热销，\n以及原材料成本压力能不能顺利传导。",
    "start": 216.192,
    "end": 222.74,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "新车型",
      "ES9",
      "热销"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这些细节在完整报告里有更深入的分析。",
    "start": 223.1,
    "end": 227.372,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "完整报告"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那这份报告里还有哪些没有完全展开的悬\n念？",
    "start": 227.732,
    "end": 231.865,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "悬念"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告里提到，ES9的发布可能会影响到\nES8的订单结构，但具体会怎么演变，\n需要等正式上市后的数据。另外，",
    "start": 232.225,
    "end": 242.907,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "ES9",
      "发布",
      "ES8"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "管理层说五座版ES8在下半年推出，这\n个新车型对品牌高端定位的支撑作用，也\n是值得持续跟踪的。",
    "start": 243.267,
    "end": 252.601,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "五座版ES8",
      "下半年",
      "品牌高端定位"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "看来想了解蔚来下半年的完整逻辑，还得\n去读完整报告。如果想获取更多类似的深\n度解读，可以加入我们的研报社群，",
    "start": 252.961,
    "end": 263.874,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "蔚来",
      "下半年",
      "完整报告"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "每周都有精选的投行分析。",
    "start": 264.234,
    "end": 266.742,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "每周",
      "投行分析"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，完整报告里还有更详细的财务模型和\n风险提示，能帮你更系统地理解这家公司\n的研究逻辑。",
